## Description

Nvidia has proven to be a big supporter of open source models.

Chris Alexiuk, a senior product engineer at Nvidia, expanded on this as "Nvidia's mission." Developing  open source technology as a means to better their own future products, and the community at large.

We applaud the reasoning and think of it as a true necessity to bringing AI to the world.

